    \item Improved long-tail edge-case handling through targeted synthetic data augmentation pipelines.
\end{{itemize}}

\vspace{{3pt}}

\noindent\textbf{{Machine Learning Engineer}} \hfill \textbf{{*********}}\\
\textit{{Redmond, WA}} \hfill \textit{{Jul 2021 -- Mar 2023}}
\begin{{itemize}}
    \item Built and maintained ML pipelines on Azure ML for large-scale NLP model fine-tuning.
    \item Reduced model training costs by 30\% through mixed-precision training and gradient checkpointing.
\end{{itemize}}

\vspace{{3pt}}

\noindent\textbf{{Applied Scientist Intern}} \hfill \textbf{{*******}}\\
\textit{{New York, NY}} \hfill \textit{{May 2020 -- Aug 2020}}
